    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 3,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
            "key": "$darkalley_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "The children are gone. And with them your hope of victory."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Put down your weapons, kneel before me, and your 'Family' will have at least some chance to survive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Do you really think your threats mean anything?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...You are on our land. It means to us what Siracusa means to you. You must know this much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You still have some chips on the table, young man. Wouldn't you like to save them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A",
        "text": "Qui- quicksand?! Run!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B",
        "text": "Aaaaaagh! My hand! D- don't touch the sand!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You cocky\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Calm yourself, young man. I don't need my hands to stop your sword."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Look around you at your companions. This city has bled so much already. I really don't want to see 'Family' killing one another on the program."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "This is your last chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "I ain't gonna turn coward again. Leaving Siracusa was the last step backwards for my Family."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "I'd rather die here like a true Sicilian than ever let the enemy see me run off with my tail between my legs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Perhaps in your mind, this is the way for a warrior to behave. But for a leader, going too far is as bad as not going far enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You should reflect, and introspect. Unfortunately, it is too late."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Aaaagh!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "...This is the end, Gambino. You should never have bet the whole Family on this."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Capone, you, you son of a\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_028#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Calm down. We don't want you to go out too hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$knifegore",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Funny. You don't look surprised at all. Were you waiting for me to do this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "What are you thinking, backstabbing boss-killer?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "I'll offer up the whole Family. We're gonna live here, in Lungmen. And we're not gonna fall on our swords for no good reason."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "It's too bad... if you were truly willing to work together, that woman never would have exiled you from Siracusa."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You know a lot about us... But I'm not gonna ask. It's Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Indeed. It's Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You mean I should be easier on you, since you're willing to personally discipline the disobedient?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "My Family will take orders from you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "'Your Family.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You are simply describing the situation as it is. You made so many miscalculations you have no other choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Right. It's been a hell of a night. I've had a lotta setbacks. But that's business."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Mmm... Business."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You're absolutely right. This is an excellent deal. Fair and equitable."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Then\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$kingmouse_intro",
            "key": "$kingmouse_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "But, Mr. Capone, it's Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "It's not me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I have no need of your loyalty. Never did."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
            "volume": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You... from the very beginning, you were..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso ",
        "text": "It's what it is. We gotta survive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "When you tried to worm your way into Lungmen, your mutual suspicion ground turned you up into a sheet of sand. A stone is hard to break. But sand? I can easily scoop up a handful."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I have no love of trickery. It's really no fun at all. What matters is what I said a few minutes ago: I truly do not wish to see family massacre family..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "And yet you did harm to your own brother, right in front of me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Now for this, I would not say you've crossed the ultimate line. So I will not kill you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "It's just that, since you disobeyed me, I'm afraid I have no need of such a crafty and conniving friend."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You...! You had these moles in the Family from the very beginning! And you waited until we got at each other's throats, and then you...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$e_skill_driftsand",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You're wasting your life on idle words, young man."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Heh... while you toyed around with the power over them, your underlings were mulling it all over for you. Truly remarkable."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Their loyalty has bought them a chance to survive in Lungmen. And a life for each of you as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Now then, you have seen for yourselves the choices made by these two leaders, and now the time has come for you to fulfill your commitments."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "...Heh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Rat King. No, Lin. Lin Gray, you're more Sicilian than either of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You tore my honor to shreds, and then you let me live? Are you trying to humiliate me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_031"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Astonishing. To save your life, you don't hesitate to draw a sword on your own brother, your own leader, and yet when I offer to let you live, you are determined to die?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "I thought only the one out cold over there would gnash his teeth at me so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "That's because I too am 'Sicilian.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Or I guess I should ask if you really thought you could wipe out one of Siracusa's 'Families' and get away with it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Idle threats. You must know that nobody will go to war over an erased Family. Take a step back and see that even though some hopeless, scattered warriors may ignorantly think to act..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...I say let them come. Let them be torn to shreds by the true rage of this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#7",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Grr!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "You alone have no power to stand against us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "Now. Go."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_027#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "...I guess my life just has to go on for now, but one day you'll regret that you didn't kill me, a true Sicilian, today."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "No question."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "...If I were to send a man to kill him now, what would you do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "You wouldn't do that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rat King",
        "text": "But what he said is true. I have no reason to be so lenient with a Siracusan mafioso."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso",
        "text": "We had a deal. When we came face to face, we'd defect, and you'd let the others go."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_034#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_031",
